window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Xenofall is coming.</p> <p>Shanti returns to a divided Red Wild. Isaru, the puppet of Rakhim Shal, now rules from Haven. He plans to attack Colonia itself to win the support of the bickering Elekai kingdoms.</p> <p>Meanwhile, a resistance recognizing Shanti as Anna Reborn has formed at Kalear. But it will be crushed unless she can find further support. Lurking behind everything is the sinister power of the Hyperfold.</p> <p>Its dissolution could mean the death of the Xenofold itself...</p>"; 
